        <p class="hero__lede rv" style="--d:2">Across enterprise systems, the same categories of design-level risk appear repeatedly. These are the structural weaknesses our security architecture review targets, each one a class of flaw that is far cheaper to resolve at the design stage than after deployment.</p>
